WEBVTT

00:00:06.314 --> 00:00:08.142
[both scream]

00:00:08.316 --> 00:00:09.491
Eep, wait, wait, wait.

00:00:09.665 --> 00:00:10.275
There's something
I need to tell you.

00:00:10.449 --> 00:00:11.450
Now?

00:00:11.624 --> 00:00:13.147
[roaring]

00:00:13.321 --> 00:00:15.280
I spent my whole life

00:00:15.454 --> 00:00:18.022
searching for a place called
Tomorrow, but it isn't a...

00:00:18.196 --> 00:00:20.502
[screams]

00:00:20.676 --> 00:00:22.548
-Whoa!
-Go on.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:25.159
But Tomorrow isn't a place.

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:27.901
It's a person. It's you, Eep.

00:00:29.337 --> 00:00:31.339
You are my Tomorrow.

00:00:31.513 --> 00:00:33.341
Really?

00:00:33.515 --> 00:00:35.953
[both scream]

00:00:41.045 --> 00:00:42.394
[Guy grunts, gasps]

00:00:42.568 --> 00:00:44.265
[growling]

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:46.746
[deep chuckling]

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.008
[both screaming]

00:00:50.445 --> 00:00:52.447
[all grunting]

00:00:54.841 --> 00:00:56.147
[groaning]

00:00:56.321 --> 00:00:57.322
-[whoops]
-Yeah!

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:00.368
[yells]

00:01:00.542 --> 00:01:02.457
Take that!

00:01:05.634 --> 00:01:07.027
[screaming wildly]

00:01:07.201 --> 00:01:08.594
D'oh!

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:09.899
[grunts]

00:01:10.074 --> 00:01:11.858
I think I made him madder.

00:01:12.032 --> 00:01:13.686
[roaring]

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:14.992
Run!

00:01:16.645 --> 00:01:17.820
-Come on! Get under here!
-[screaming]

00:01:20.214 --> 00:01:21.433
[gasps]

00:01:21.607 --> 00:01:23.391
-We've got to drop this thing.
-How?

00:01:23.565 --> 00:01:24.871
There's too many vines.

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:30.659
-Hey!
-Hey!

00:01:32.966 --> 00:01:34.446
-[roars]
-[both scream]

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:36.491
-[roars]
-[both scream]

00:01:39.146 --> 00:01:40.800
-[roars]
-[all scream]

00:01:43.846 --> 00:01:46.240
[screaming]

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.988
[squeals]

00:01:57.991 --> 00:02:00.298
Wow. I can't believe
that actually work...

00:02:00.472 --> 00:02:02.604
♪ I think I love you ♪

00:02:02.778 --> 00:02:05.172
-♪ I think I love you♪
-[distant roaring]

00:02:05.346 --> 00:02:06.347
-[laughing, cheering]
-♪ I think I love you ♪

00:02:06.521 --> 00:02:09.611
♪ So what am I so afraid of? ♪

00:02:09.785 --> 00:02:11.787
♪ I'm afraid that
I'm not sure of ♪

00:02:11.961 --> 00:02:14.834
-♪ A love there is
no cure for ♪ -[laughing]

00:02:16.705 --> 00:02:18.664
-[whooping]
-♪ I think I love you ♪

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:20.187
♪ Isn't that what life
is made of... ♪

00:02:20.361 --> 00:02:21.014
-[rumbling]
-[shouts]

00:02:21.188 --> 00:02:22.363
GUY:
No!

00:02:22.537 --> 00:02:24.148
[Eep screaming]

00:02:24.322 --> 00:02:26.019
-Eep! Eep!
-No!

00:02:26.193 --> 00:02:27.368
I got you!

00:02:27.542 --> 00:02:29.805
-[yelling]
-[roaring]

00:02:32.765 --> 00:02:33.679
[panting]

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:35.202
You know what?

00:02:35.376 --> 00:02:37.596
-That's not my real toe.
-[confused grunt]

00:02:38.727 --> 00:02:39.641
[toe pops]

00:02:39.815 --> 00:02:41.208
[confused grunt]

00:02:41.382 --> 00:02:43.036
-[roaring]
-♪ I think I love you ♪

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:44.690
♪ Isn't that what life
is made of... ♪

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:47.127
You never told me about that.

00:02:47.301 --> 00:02:48.520
Did you know
she had a peanut toe?

00:02:48.694 --> 00:02:49.564
No.

00:02:49.738 --> 00:02:51.740
[excited chatter]

00:02:55.222 --> 00:02:57.050
[song fades]

00:02:57.224 --> 00:02:58.747
[birds chirping]

00:02:58.921 --> 00:03:01.141
GUY:
Travel log:

00:03:01.315 --> 00:03:03.187
final entry.

00:03:03.361 --> 00:03:06.799
After two of the longest, most
terrifying moons of my life,

00:03:06.973 --> 00:03:10.411
the Croods and the Bettermans
made it back together.

00:03:10.585 --> 00:03:12.021
[panting, barks]

00:03:12.196 --> 00:03:13.675
-Douglas?
-[barks]

00:03:13.849 --> 00:03:14.720
Douglas!

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.896
-[yapping]
-Douglas!

00:03:19.594 --> 00:03:21.292
-[screams]
-[barks, pants]

00:03:21.466 --> 00:03:22.467
Oh! Whew!

00:03:22.641 --> 00:03:24.033
GUY:
And the Bettermans

00:03:24.208 --> 00:03:26.297
welcomed everyone
to stay, forever.

00:03:26.471 --> 00:03:28.037
So we made a few changes
around the farm.

00:03:28.212 --> 00:03:29.430
[Ugga grunts]

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:33.042
Yeah, it really
opens up the place.

00:03:33.217 --> 00:03:35.044
-Right?
-[excited chatter]

00:03:35.219 --> 00:03:36.089
GUY:
Oh, and the punch monkeys

00:03:36.263 --> 00:03:37.177
moved in next door.

00:03:37.351 --> 00:03:40.572
Man, do they party, a lot!

00:03:40.746 --> 00:03:42.313
All day, all night.

00:03:42.487 --> 00:03:45.359
Phil actually learned
to speak punch monkey.

00:03:45.533 --> 00:03:47.492
Okay. I'll get you that recipe.

00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:48.928
-Don't you worry.
-GUY: And Grug?

00:03:49.102 --> 00:03:50.538
Uh, come again?

00:03:50.712 --> 00:03:51.974
GUY:
Well, he's still working on it.

00:03:52.149 --> 00:03:53.672
[groans] One more time.

00:03:53.846 --> 00:03:54.977
-EEP: Hey, babe.
-Uh, one more time.

00:03:55.152 --> 00:03:56.979
-Get to the good part!
-GUY: Oh, yeah.

00:03:57.154 --> 00:03:58.198
[chuckles] Right.

00:03:58.372 --> 00:03:59.721
Those weren't the only changes.

00:03:59.895 --> 00:04:02.159
Oh, I'm really gonna miss you.

00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:05.423
Your mother and I are here
if you need us.

00:04:05.597 --> 00:04:08.034
-Boom?
-Boom.

00:04:09.731 --> 00:04:11.733
Get in here, son.

00:04:14.432 --> 00:04:15.998
Goodbye, Dad.

00:04:16.173 --> 00:04:17.826
Our baby's leaving.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.567
[Grug sobbing]

00:04:19.741 --> 00:04:21.787
Our baby's leaving!

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:24.006
[sobbing loudly]

00:04:28.881 --> 00:04:30.448
Boomsies?

00:04:30.622 --> 00:04:31.797
[gasps, chuckles]

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:33.712
BOTH:
Boom.

00:04:33.886 --> 00:04:34.974
-Hey, everyone!
-[Sandy laughing]

00:04:35.148 --> 00:04:36.758
Sandy said her first word!

00:04:36.932 --> 00:04:39.021
Sandy said, "Boomsies!"

00:04:39.196 --> 00:04:42.590
-[roars]
-[Eep and Dawn whooping]

00:04:42.764 --> 00:04:44.026
-Hey.
-"Hey" what?

00:04:44.201 --> 00:04:45.463
Hey, you.

00:04:45.637 --> 00:04:47.769
♪ Dun-dun-da? ♪

00:04:47.943 --> 00:04:50.729
[chattering excitedly]

00:04:50.903 --> 00:04:53.732
Oh, Gran, did you do
something new with your hair?

00:04:53.906 --> 00:04:55.429
Oh, this?

00:04:55.603 --> 00:04:58.911
Wigasus took the day off,
so I'm trying a new do.

00:04:59.085 --> 00:05:00.608
[screeching]

00:05:00.782 --> 00:05:02.480
-Thunk, no window at the table.
-[Thunk groans]

00:05:02.654 --> 00:05:04.003
Who's hungry?

00:05:04.177 --> 00:05:07.136
It's a special dish
we call Bronana Bread.

00:05:07.311 --> 00:05:09.704
EEP: My father was afraid
of the pack getting smaller.

00:05:09.878 --> 00:05:12.359
GUY:
But in the end, it got bigger.

00:05:12.533 --> 00:05:14.361
A whole lot bigger.

00:05:14.535 --> 00:05:16.189
EEP:
Dad was right after all.

00:05:16.363 --> 00:05:18.713
We were stronger together.

00:05:18.887 --> 00:05:19.975
[screeching]

00:05:20.149 --> 00:05:21.325
[thud]

00:05:21.499 --> 00:05:23.283
[glass squeaking]

00:05:23.457 --> 00:05:27.766
♪ We're talking
ba, ba-ba-ba, ba-ba ♪

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:28.984
♪ Ba-ba, ba ♪

00:05:29.158 --> 00:05:33.467
♪ Ba, ba-ba-ba-ba ♪

00:05:33.641 --> 00:05:36.949
♪ I was sleeping, and right in
the middle of a good dream ♪

00:05:37.123 --> 00:05:39.125
♪ Like all at once, I wake up ♪

00:05:39.299 --> 00:05:42.824
♪ From something that keeps
knocking at my brain ♪

00:05:42.998 --> 00:05:47.438
♪ Before I go insane,
I hold my pillow to my head ♪

00:05:47.612 --> 00:05:49.178
♪ And spring up in my bed ♪

00:05:49.353 --> 00:05:51.398
♪ Screaming out
the words I dread ♪

00:05:51.572 --> 00:05:55.010
♪ I think I love you ♪

00:05:55.184 --> 00:05:58.623
-♪ I think I love you♪
-♪ I think I love you ♪

00:05:58.797 --> 00:06:00.320
♪ So what am I so afraid of? ♪

00:06:00.494 --> 00:06:02.322
♪ I'm afraid that
I'm not sure of ♪

00:06:02.496 --> 00:06:06.108
♪ A love there is no cure for ♪

